---
import PortfolioItem from '../components/PortfolioItem.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Portfolio | Freelance Web Developer Projects & Case Studies"
    description="Freelance web development portfolio: WordPress CMS builds, design systems and component libraries for agencies incl. Bladonmore, Living Group, The Team.">
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8 flow">
                    <h1 class="">Portfolio</h1>
                    <p class="text-lg">
                        I've worked with numerous design, digital and communication agencies including Bladonmore, The Team, Living Group, Pixeled Eggs, Artery
                        Digital and Havas Faze.
                    </p>
                    <p>A selection of my recent work - last updated May 2026</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid">
                <PortfolioItem title="Living Group">
                    <p>
                        I've worked for <a href="https://www.living-group.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">living-group.com</a> on multiple projects delivering
                        front end component/template libraries, recently including:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="ps-0" role="list">
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://gittingsglobal.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">gittingsglobal.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.mcneeslaw.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">mcneeslaw.com</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </PortfolioItem>
                <PortfolioItem title="Bladonmore">
                    <p>
                        I've been working for <a href="https://www.bladonmore.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">bladonmore.com</a> on multiple projects over
                        the last 5 years, for a range of clients producing flexible component based Wordpress CMS sites.
                    </p>
                    <p>A couple of recent examples of projects I worked on for them include:</p>
                    <ul class="ps-0" role="list">
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.tetragoninv.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">tetragoninv.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.gladstoneplace.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">gladstoneplace.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.bladonmore.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">bladonmore.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.first-quantum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">first-quantum.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.ritcap.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ritcap.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.arapartners.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">arapartners.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.royaltypharma.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">royaltypharma.com</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </PortfolioItem>

                <PortfolioItem title="The Team">
                    <p>I've worked on multiple projects for The Team over the years including large scale design systems and websites for NS&I:</p>
                    <ul class="ps-0" role="list">
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.nsandi.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">nsandi.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.nsandi-corporate.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">nsandi-corporate.com</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </PortfolioItem>
                <PortfolioItem title="VIPA Digital">
                    <p>
                        VIPA Digital recently had a brand/design refresh (design by <a href="https://www.marmaladesign.co.uk/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
                            >marmaladesign.co.uk</a
                        >) and they wanted to apply this to a new website, as well as improving the site User Experience and CMS ease of use/capabilities.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Website was replatformed to Wordpress CMS using ACF Blocks to create a flexible page editing experience, and hosted on Kinsta for
                        performance and security.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="ps-0" role="list">
                        <li><a href="https://vipadigital.com/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">vipadigital.com</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </PortfolioItem>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
